Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:16.76,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:25.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:36.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:44.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:51.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:55.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.88,0:01:00.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:05.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:11.20,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:14.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:20.32,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:23.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:27.20,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:29.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:34.00,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:38.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:43.20,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:47.52,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:56.68,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:06.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(229,442)\fad(300,300)}Above Planet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must hurry back to the Thunder Celestial Temple !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:12.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as I return...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.39,0:02:14.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not escaping !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:40.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,That damned beast
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:42.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,actually dared to betray me !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:47.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,There was
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,a misunderstanding between us earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:52.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,A misunderstanding ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.39,0:02:58.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm a Thunder Celestial Messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.39,0:03:00.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you dare touch me !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.19,0:03:01.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunder barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,appear !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.83,0:03:24.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,This man exhausted his origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:25.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Killing him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.03,0:03:28.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,would be as easy as flipping my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:33.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it would be a shame to waste his Illusory Yin body...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:41.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open the thunder barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:44.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I will spare your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.59,0:03:54.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:56.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,there is no irreconcilable grudge between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:03:58.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,What exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:03:59.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you want ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:14.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,A restriction mark ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.43,0:04:18.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,He wants me to acknowledge him as my master ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.95,0:04:19.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,How arrogant !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.31,0:04:25.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pure thunder energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.15,0:04:29.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's indeed a high-grade material for refining a Celestial Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:31.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:43.15,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(211,472)}Barren mountains\NAbandoned planet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.55,0:04:46.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,This damn beast...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:04:58.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:00.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want me to acknowledge you as my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:01.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very well !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,But after you imprint the slave restriction,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.43,0:05:05.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must let me leave !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:07.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Slave restriction ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:10.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's what he thought this was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:11.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:13.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you break your promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.11,0:05:16.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will use the Thunder Celestial Temple's life-saving spell !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:19.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if I have to exhaust my entire lifespan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:21.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will burn everything down with you !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:28.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how profound this slave restriction is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will be able to break it easily
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:33.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,once I recover some origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:36.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,After that, I will return to the Thunder Celestial Temple
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:37.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,and make sure that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.63,0:05:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,he dies without a grave !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:48.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,An artifact that targets the Origin Soul ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.63,0:05:49.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:50.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are you doing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:54.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,To make sure the slave restriction is safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:57.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to temporarily extract your Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:05:59.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why do you need to extract my Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:00.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,for an ordinary slave restriction !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:01.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:04.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you really refining my body into a puppet !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:06.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,give me my body back !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:27.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,526)\fad(800,600)}10 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.47,0:06:38.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Silver grade !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:43.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:45.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,you tricked me !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.43,0:06:46.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,You thought you were clever
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:48.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,and assumed it was a slave restriction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:53.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.87,0:06:54.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:56.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,I admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.11,0:07:00.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if my Origin Soul is unwilling,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.87,0:07:02.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,the puppet will be difficult to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:03.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,At worst,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.39,0:07:05.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,both my body and my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:06.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be destroyed !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:12.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will be my puppet for 3000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:13.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:22.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sword energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:25.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if I use my lifespan and the life-saving spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.59,0:07:28.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The puppet from earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:33.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,was incredibly strong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:36.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,and looks extremely sturdy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:38.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he refines my physical body,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.19,0:07:42.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,it should be able to last 3000 years, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:03.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The thunder energy of these three has the same origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:06.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're perfect for refining a Celestial Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:10.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I do my best to cooperate,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,he should be able to successfully refine me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:14.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,will only survive if he succeeds !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(163,422)}6 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:55.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,It failed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:57.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Origin Soul dissipated...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:08:59.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:02.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,this Celestial Guard won't be able to use any spells at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:09.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,I thought that with an Illusory Yin body and Thunder Beast essence blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:12.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,it would be enough to refine a mid-grade Celestial Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:15.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looking at it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:17.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,raising a Celestial Guard's grade
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.19,0:09:19.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,is very unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.95,0:09:22.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:25.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,At least I didn't lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,This body has reached the peak of silver-grade
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.07,0:09:29.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,and is intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:32.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,When my Origin Soul is able to leave my body once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:35.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might be able to control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.15,0:09:46.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,A jade from the Thunder Celestial Temple ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.39,0:09:51.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a powerful thunder barrier...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Furnace Becomes the World ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:12.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Use your own Dao to create a cauldron,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:14.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,and refine the world with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.27,0:10:17.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:20.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,this spell requires too much origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.75,0:10:22.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't use it before
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.55,0:10:24.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,I reach Illusory Yin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:28.51,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(229,452)}Thunder Origin Spell
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:30.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absorb origin energy from thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:32.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,and quickly condense it into your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:35.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will reduce the time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.87,0:10:37.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,one stays at the Yin and Yang realms...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.75,0:10:41.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can actually condense the thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:43.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,into origin energy for cultivation !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:46.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the help of this spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:48.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will be able to reduce the time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.03,0:10:50.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will take for me to reach the second step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:53.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Thunder Origin Spell is so powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.55,0:10:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,that without a thunder body,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:10:57.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,cultivating it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:10:59.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,would be the same as digging your grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:02.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder the Thunder Celestial Temple monopolizes it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:05.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,and rules the Allheaven Star System.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.99,0:11:09.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that I have a Thunder Celestial Temple token,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:12.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if a real Thunder Celestial Messenger were to encounter me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:15.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,they wouldn't be able to see through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:19.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,He was just a messenger,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,but he was incredibly wealthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:25.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Thunder Celestial Temple
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.87,0:11:27.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,is truly unfathomable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:30.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,With these celestial jades,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:32.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Late stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:34.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,is within reach !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.95,0:11:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(155,403)\fad(600,600)}6 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.79,0:12:16.03,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(202,479)}Wang Lin's avatar\NLate stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.15,0:12:18.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,My cultivation has stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:21.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's time to probe the secret of the Moongazer Serpent once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:25.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,The flame metal vein is crucial to completing the Heaven Defying Bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.27,0:12:27.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if it's a bone of the Moongazer Serpent,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.99,0:12:30.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am determined to obtain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:35.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Yun Xia is actually a sleeping Moongazer Serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:38.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the beast wakes up while I am extracting its bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:40.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.79,0:12:43.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,For this mission to succeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:46.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need a huge number of Celestial Ascension Fruits
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:47.99,Map,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,000)\pos(958,579)}Planet\NThousand\NIllusions
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:47.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,to temporarily paralyze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.99,0:12:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,600)\pos(192,454)}half a month later
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:02.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder which messenger has graced our humble planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:04.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,The entire Huan Family has failed to welcome you properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:06.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,please forgive our manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:08.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Head of the Huan Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:10.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:12.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,This voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.67,0:13:13.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:16.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huan Fengshen, Head of the Huan Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:18.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,pays respects to Lord Messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.91,0:13:19.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:21.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,we didn't know your identity
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:22.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,and have offended you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.79,0:13:24.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope Lord Messenger can forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:27.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,He came this time
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:29.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,to settle the score...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:31.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reason I have come this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:34.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to take your Huan Family's Celestial Ascension Fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:36.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Messenger,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.91,0:13:37.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,those Celestial Ascension Fruits
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:39.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,are crucial for our Huan Family to enter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Thunder Celestial Realm in 100 years !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:41.71,Third,,0,0,0,,Shut up !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:47.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Messenger,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:48.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,our Huan Family
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:53.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,is willing to give up our qualification to enter the Thunder Celestial Realm in 100 years
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:56.03,Third,,0,0,0,,Celestial Ascension Fruits
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.55,0:13:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,and offer our Celestial Ascension Fruits
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.03,0:13:57.70,Third,,0,0,0,,are related to the Thunder Celestial Realm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.03,0:13:57.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,to show our dedication to you, Lord Messenger !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:58.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just want to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:00.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,to forget our old grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.63,0:14:09.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Messenger,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:11.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,they're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.95,0:14:25.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,We bid farewell to Lord Messenger !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.43,0:14:29.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Thunder Celestial Messenger identity
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.35,0:14:31.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,is quite useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:34.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looks like I can use this as an excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:36.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the Northern Domain of Allheaven
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:38.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,to do what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:42.83,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(278,475)}Qian Family's Ancestral Home\NPlanet Thousand Illusions
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:43.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Kuizi of the Qian Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.63,0:14:44.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,pays respects to Messenger Xu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.71,0:14:46.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to Messenger Xu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:47.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Qian Kuizi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.47,0:14:49.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't dare to call myself your Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.03,0:14:52.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,you flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.07,0:14:56.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard that you are looking for Celestial Ascension Fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.15,0:14:58.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our Qian Family has prepared a small gift
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:01.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,that we wish to present to you as a token of our appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:04.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is well-informed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:07.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,and is putting on this show...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:10.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,He really is an old fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.59,0:15:13.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Messenger, wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:16.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,I humbly ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.91,0:15:17.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,to please show us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.11,0:15:20.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,your Thunder Celestial Temple token
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.39,0:15:22.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,to let us witness its divine might.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:26.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, you don't trust me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.35,0:15:30.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.35,0:15:32.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Allheaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:35.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,who doesn't know that there are only 99 Thunder Celestial Messengers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:36.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Their status
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:37.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,is sky high.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.55,0:15:40.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,How would I dare to offend one ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.03,0:15:46.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Thunder Celestial Temple token
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:47.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,can't be counterfeited.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.79,0:15:50.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's been less than 100 years
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:52.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,and he has already reached Late stage Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.79,0:15:54.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:56.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should bet on him early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.43,0:16:06.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's one more thing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:08.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I need to ask Messenger Xu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:09.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:11.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunder Celestial Messengers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:14.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,all have subordinate families.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:16.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you're willing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:18.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can promise on my Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:21.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,that when you reach Illusory Yin,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.91,0:16:24.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,our Qian Family will become your subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:26.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunder Celestial Messengers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.83,0:16:30.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,can actually develop their own affiliated forces ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:35.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,If my true identity is exposed, it will backfire on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.47,0:16:38.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that happens, I won't be able to protect them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:40.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it would destroy their family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:43.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't accept
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:45.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,this karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:47.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I appreciate
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:48.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,your kind offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.91,0:16:50.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's drop this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.71,0:16:58.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,It must be because of what happened with Huan Wuqing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.19,0:17:00.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,He still holds a grudge against me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.07,0:17:03.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I probed him even more today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:07.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:10.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,This messenger title
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.19,0:17:12.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a bit too grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:16.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:18.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as it's useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get the fruits !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.03,0:17:44.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\pos(162,418)}6 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.27,0:17:45.43,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1713,504)\fad(300,300)}Starry Sky\NNorthern Domain\NAllheaven Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:48.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,After spending all this time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.03,0:17:50.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,traveling across the Northern Domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:53.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have finally gathered enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I took the risk of unlocking 3 of its seals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.31,0:18:16.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although there was no backlash,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:18.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,it has developed quite a temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.15,0:18:31.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Yun Xia...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:34.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,If this mission succeeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll use the Moongazer Serpent's bone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.19,0:18:37.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,to complete the metal element
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.31,0:18:41.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Heaven Defying Bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:43.99,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(226,428)\fad(300,300)}Above Planet Yun Xia
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:52.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,In these 70 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.11,0:18:54.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's the eighth attempt !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:58.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will definitely escape this time !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.47,0:19:11.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:15.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's all because of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:17.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:19.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't come to this Allheaven Star System,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:23.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,this old man wouldn't have ended up in such a situation !
Dialogue: 100,0:19:34.11,0:22:07.95,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)}While Wang Lin is reaching Late stage Ascendant, we got a chapter in the novel about what's happening in the Alliance Star System. The information below will probably be adapted later.\N\NZi Xin (the woman who absorbed Qian Feng's cultivation) became a concubine of the Blood Ancestor. She investigates an abandonned planet where the Ancient God original body was cultivating. The original body had absorbed the whole planet's energy so it collapses entirely. However, its cultivation is stuck and not able to reach 4-stars without the aura of an adult Ancient God.\N\NOn planet Suzaku, deep in the Sea of Devils, in the Land of the Ancient God, Tuo Sens is still plotting.\N“Wang Lin, I’m about to be free…”\NA person with a monkey on its shoulder walks out of the Chaotic Broken Stars. That person is the Sky Devil Magician, the master of the Six Desires Devil Lord.\N“The realm under the Thunder Celestial Realm…” Sky Devil Magician’s body flickered and left planet Suzaku.\N\NOn Mount Suzaku, Zhou Ru had just reached Nascent Soul. She's now able to open the bag of holding Wang Lin gave Tie Yan before he left. Inside that bag, there was nothing but a white light that entered her head. Her memories of what happened that Wang Lin had sealed flash before her eyes.\NTears appeared on Zhou Ru’s face, and after a long time, she lowered her head, sat down, and hugged her knees. She couldn’t stop her tears.\N“Little White, it turns out Uncle never wanted me to find him…”
