Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.73,0:20:08.41,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:07.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:13.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.29,0:20:11.85,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,638)\fad(800,300)}Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:15.05,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:13.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}stand in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.53,0:20:20.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.37,0:20:21.33,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:20.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.81,0:20:26.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.19,0:20:26.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:33.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:33.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:39.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:39.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.09,0:20:46.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:46.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.57,0:20:51.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:51.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:54.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.45,0:20:54.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.93,0:21:00.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:21:00.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.89,0:21:04.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.25,0:21:04.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:07.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:07.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:13.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.81,0:21:13.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:19.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:19.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}this is what my journey to treading the heavens relies on.
